@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title Summarising a student's progress

participant ":ScoreCommands" as Commands
participant "ArgumentParser" as Parser <<class>>
participant ":TutorLedgerData" as Data

[-> Commands : execute("progress S1 from/01-09-2026")
activate Commands
Commands -> Data : getStudent("S1")
activate Data
Data --> Commands : student
deactivate Data
Commands -> Parser : parseFields("from/01-09-2026", [from, to])
activate Parser
Parser --> Commands : fields
deactivate Parser

Commands -> Data : getLessons()
activate Data
Data --> Commands : all lessons
deactivate Data
Commands -> Commands : attendanceSummary(S1's lessons in period)
activate Commands
Commands --> Commands : attendance summary
deactivate Commands

Commands -> Data : getScores()
activate Data
Data --> Commands : all scores
deactivate Data
Commands -> Commands : scoreTable(...), trend(...)
activate Commands
Commands --> Commands : score table, trend
deactivate Commands

Commands -->[ : attendance, scores, average and trend
deactivate Commands
note over Commands, Data
  The activity diagram below shows which lessons attendanceSummary counts.
end note
@enduml
